{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>'Talk your way out of torture. Or don't. They love that.'</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONVERSATION \u2013 THE MAIN GAMEPLAY MECHANIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bot Colony _redux is a first-of-its-kind sci-fi thriller where you speak freely with AI characters \u2014 and they speak back. You\u2019re tied to a chair, interrogated by robots trying to decide if you\u2019re human. Prove it with your own words... or live to see the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploring the game world your way, using your own words, may feel new to players used to clicking on choices in dialogue trees. We achieve immersion with natural speech-to-text, character intelligence, and great-sounding, emotive text-to-speech.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/voicegameplay.png?t=1749051997\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RIOT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo,</strong> you'll get a sample of the &quot;Riot&quot; level. You fly a Hunter Bot to an abandoned oil rig in the Pacific Ocean. Programmed to behave like humans, the robots staged a mutiny and split into factions. You'll have to pilot the Hunter Bot and help him take out hostile sentries before it's safe to land on the rig.  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/hunterbot.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After landing, you're ambushed by insect bots and thrust into a desperate fight to defend the disabled Hunter Bot and avoid capture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/cockpit.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Next you will experience the <strong>Humanity Test</strong>: This is a reverse of the Voigt-Kamp test in Blade Runner (the 1982 cult movie), used to tell humans from Nexus 5 androids. In our Humanity Test, the robots kidnap <strong>you</strong>, and you must prove your humanity - saying whatever comes to mind - to survive and continue the adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk your way out of robot torture. Or don't. They love it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/humanitytest.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This dynamic, real-time interrogation showcases the unique unscripted dialogue we hope you'll enjoy in Bot Colony _redux!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664740?t=1749051997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664740?t=1749051997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/71561eb2d7ac314d280bca38e1ef1ae660913da7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749051997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/71561eb2d7ac314d280bca38e1ef1ae660913da7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749051997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A bit of spicy language from certain bot characters, and they torture the player for answers with robotic punishments (but no crazy blood and guts)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>'Talk your way out of torture. Or don't. They love that.'</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONVERSATION \u2013 THE MAIN GAMEPLAY MECHANIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bot Colony _redux is a first-of-its-kind sci-fi thriller where you speak freely with AI characters \u2014 and they speak back. You\u2019re tied to a chair, interrogated by robots trying to decide if you\u2019re human. Prove it with your own words... or live to see the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploring the game world your way, using your own words, may feel new to players used to clicking on choices in dialogue trees. We achieve immersion with natural speech-to-text, character intelligence, and great-sounding, emotive text-to-speech.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/voicegameplay.png?t=1749051997\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RIOT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo,</strong> you'll get a sample of the &quot;Riot&quot; level. You fly a Hunter Bot to an abandoned oil rig in the Pacific Ocean. Programmed to behave like humans, the robots staged a mutiny and split into factions. You'll have to pilot the Hunter Bot and help him take out hostile sentries before it's safe to land on the rig.  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/hunterbot.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After landing, you're ambushed by insect bots and thrust into a desperate fight to defend the disabled Hunter Bot and avoid capture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/cockpit.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Next you will experience the <strong>Humanity Test</strong>: This is a reverse of the Voigt-Kamp test in Blade Runner (the 1982 cult movie), used to tell humans from Nexus 5 androids. In our Humanity Test, the robots kidnap <strong>you</strong>, and you must prove your humanity - saying whatever comes to mind - to survive and continue the adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk your way out of robot torture. Or don't. They love it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/extras/humanitytest.gif?t=1749051997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This dynamic, real-time interrogation showcases the unique unscripted dialogue we hope you'll enjoy in Bot Colony _redux!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["North Side Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3613080","name":"Bot Colony _redux"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/271198b3e4c57754e00695957af41e67a84d466c/header.jpg?t=1749051997","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Bot Colony is a trademark of North Side Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140315,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140315/movie480.mp4?t=1748442785","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140315/movie_max.mp4?t=1748442785"},"name":"Bot Colony _redux Story Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140315/460960077a7291d643ea8c7b394fadd2e663ed64/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748442785","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140315/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748442785","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140315/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748442785"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257140339,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140339/movie480.mp4?t=1748442787","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140339/movie_max.mp4?t=1748442787"},"name":"Riot 4K Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140339/050b962912f7eb83638062c94c0fe28f81a9d96f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748442787","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor