1997","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/9a48ebd9f0f653abec59197d36c35dd995ad9045/ss_9a48ebd9f0f653abec59197d36c35dd995ad9045.600x338.jpg?t=1749051997"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/2bf797e738ea3e68524fb99feaf4966e3247a25c/ss_2bf797e738ea3e68524fb99feaf4966e3247a25c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749051997","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664740/2bf797e738ea3e68524fb99feaf4966e3247a25c/ss_2bf797e738ea3e68524fb99feaf4966e3247a25c.600x338.jpg?t=1749051997"}],"short_description":"Bot Colony _redux is a story-based sci-fi adventure game. You advance in the game by speaking to robotic characters who answer intelligently or execute commands. Interacting with characters who understand you and have unique personalities and emotions is a new, immersive game experience.","steam_appid":3664740,"support_info":{"email":"http://support@northsideinc.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}